##### This is the full, clean workflow for the FUTURES model for the EBCI Long View Project using the Console in GRASS GIS (version 8.2.0)
##### Using data from 2000-2014 for calibration period, 2015-2024 for validation (hindcast period), and 2025-2100 for future projections.
##### Note: This is a redo of previous simulations with a clean workflow in a new location (secas_sbre_aligned) set to NAD83 / Conus Albers (EPSG:5070), so that everything is in the same projection and uses the same computational region to avoid misalignement issues
##### Therefore, results may change slightly due to difference in random sampling points and stochasticity among replicates, but results in aggregate should be very similar
##### All input data is located in the PERMANENT mapset, and separate mapsets are used for SSP1, SSP2, and SSP5 simulations

######################################################################## INITIAL STEPS AND DATA PREPARATION ########################################################################

